	(text "Original drive connector (2026-11-17). J5 EXT DRV takes the original drive: every line straight from J1 except\npin 10 (SEL0, gated by U6 + Q9, so the drive is selected only when DRV_EN_N is low), pin 12 (SEL1, not passed on)\nand pins 1 + 33 (presence sense: a drive grounds its odd pins). U8 (I2C 0x41) reads the sense and drives DRV_EN_N;\nR36 holds DRV_EN_N high, so a board in reset leaves the drive deselected. With the drive on, U7 hands U2 the\nSEL2 line from J9 instead of SEL0, so the board answers DF1 (SEL1) and DF2 (SEL2) on the same GPIOs as before."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 304.8 22.86 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "8dc0cc75-f2fb-4590-a4f1-2a82c78e0f41")
	)
